{
  "title": "Constraint narrowing cases for three delegation chain drafts",
  "drafts": {
    "aat": "draft-niyikiza-oauth-attenuating-agent-tokens-02",
    "asor": "draft-asor-wimse-agent-delegation-chain-03",
    "hulea": "draft-hulea-wimse-agent-mandate-01"
  },
  "status": {
    "aat": "run through the -02 reference verifier",
    "asor": "read from the draft text; not yet reviewed by the draft's author",
    "hulea": "read from the draft text; not yet reviewed by the draft's author"
  },
  "conventions": [
    "Each case gives the same narrowing in each draft's own syntax: a parent, where relevant a child, and a request.",
    "aat: parent and child are constraint maps for the tool \"export\"; request is the argument object; chain lists [del_depth, del_max_depth] from the root.",
    "asor: parent and child are agent_delegation authorization details; request is an informal description of the action.",
    "hulea: parent and child are Permissions; request is the requested authorization detail; type_profile_admitted lists the members the Type Profile admits.",
    "child_text carries the child as literal JSON text where the spelling of a number matters.",
    "result is PERMIT, DENY, OPEN (no rule deciding the case was found in the text; the draft's author may know one) or N/A (the draft has no such construct).",
    "The aat results come from the -02 reference verifier; step is the Section 8 step that denies. The asor and hulea results are read from the draft text, have not been run against an implementation, and are their authors' to correct."
  ],
